{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20910","headline":"罗浮山父与葛篇 · 李贺","name":"罗浮山父与葛篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"依依宜织江雨空，雨中六月兰台风。\n博罗老仙时出洞，千岁石牀啼鬼工。\n蛇毒浓凝洞堂湿，江鱼不食衔沙立。\n欲剪箱中一尺天，吴娥莫道吴刀涩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20910.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20910","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}